<title>GERMANY: HOCKEY-WOMEN'S CHAMPION TROPHY STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-WOMEN'S CHAMPION TROPHY STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings after the second day of</p>
<p>the women's Champions Trophy hockey tournament on Monday:</p>
<p>		    P W D L F A Pts</p>
<p> Australia	2 1 1 0 3 1 4</p>
<p>United States  2 1 1 0 3 2 4</p>
<p> South Korea    2 1 0 1 2 1 3</p>
<p> Netherlands    2 1 0 1 1 2 3</p>
<p> Germany	  2 0 2 0 3 3 2</p>
<p> Britain	  2 0 0 2 0 3 0</p>
